<Page
    x:Class="WPF_Frame.Pages.AboutPage"
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
    xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
    xmlns:local="clr-namespace:WPF_Frame.Pages"
    xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
    Title="关于"
    d:DesignHeight="600"
    d:DesignWidth="800"
    mc:Ignorable="d">

    <Grid>
        <StackPanel
            MaxWidth="600"
            HorizontalAlignment="Center"
            VerticalAlignment="Center">
            <TextBlock
                Margin="0,0,0,30"
                HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                FontSize="28"
                FontWeight="Bold"
                Text="关于 WPF Frame 示例应用" />

            <Border
                Margin="0,0,0,20"
                Padding="25"
                CornerRadius="8">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock
                        Margin="0,0,0,10"
                        FontSize="18"
                        FontWeight="Bold"
                        Text="应用信息" />
                    <Grid Margin="10,5">
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="120" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="0"
                            Grid.Column="0"
                            FontWeight="Bold"
                            Text="版本：" />
                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="0"
                            Grid.Column="1"
                            Text="1.0.0" />

                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="1"
                            Grid.Column="0"
                            Margin="0,5,0,0"
                            FontWeight="Bold"
                            Text="开发者：" />
                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="1"
                            Grid.Column="1"
                            Margin="0,5,0,0"
                            Text="WPF Studio" />

                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="2"
                            Grid.Column="0"
                            Margin="0,5,0,0"
                            FontWeight="Bold"
                            Text="框架：" />
                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="2"
                            Grid.Column="1"
                            Margin="0,5,0,0"
                            Text=".NET 8.0, WPF" />

                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="3"
                            Grid.Column="0"
                            Margin="0,5,0,0"
                            FontWeight="Bold"
                            Text="发布日期：" />
                        <TextBlock
                            Grid.Row="3"
                            Grid.Column="1"
                            Margin="0,5,0,0"
                            Text="2024-05-01" />
                    </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border Padding="25" CornerRadius="8">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock
                        Margin="0,0,0,10"
                        FontSize="18"
                        FontWeight="Bold"
                        Text="Frame控件说明" />
                    <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap">
                        <Run>WPF中的Frame控件是一个用于页面导航的容器控件，它可以加载和显示Page对象，并提供导航历史记录管理功能。</Run>
                        <LineBreak /><LineBreak />
                        <Run>本示例演示了Frame控件的基本用法，包括：</Run>
                        <LineBreak />
                        <Run>• 基本页面导航</Run>
                        <LineBreak />
                        <Run>• 导航历史管理（前进/后退操作）</Run>
                        <LineBreak />
                        <Run>• 页面间参数传递</Run>
                        <LineBreak />
                        <Run>• 页面切换时的菜单高亮显示</Run>
                        <LineBreak /><LineBreak />
                        <Run>Frame控件是构建复杂WPF应用的重要工具，可以帮助开发者实现类似于Web应用的导航体验。</Run>
                    </TextBlock>

                    <Button
                        x:Name="ViewSourceCodeButton"
                        Margin="0,20,0,0"
                        Padding="15,5"
                        HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                        Background="#0078D7"
                        Click="ViewSourceCode_Click"
                        Content="查看源代码"
                        Foreground="White" />
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>
        </StackPanel>
    </Grid>
</Page> 